<section class="faq bg-grey faqWrapBox">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="headingWrap flexbox">
            <div class="headingsLeft">

                <h2 class="go-HighlightHeading mt10">
                    Frequently Asked <br class="mob-hide"> <span class="fr-HeadingItalic">Questions</span>
                </h2>
            </div>

        </div>
        <div class="faqWrapper ">

            <div class="faqwrap">

                <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30 active" data-rel="tab-a-1">
                    <div class="left">
                        <p class="faqHeading">How many members are allowed in a team? </p>

                        <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg" class="toggler"
                            alt="Icon">
                    </div>
                    <p class="faqanswer active" id="tab-a-1"> Each team must have 2 to 4 students from the same college.
                        No student can be part of multiple teams. All team members must be from the same college but can
                        be from different UG courses. </p>
                </div>
                <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30 " data-rel="tab-a-2">
                    <div class="left">
                        <p class="faqHeading">What prizes are up for grabs? </p>

                        <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg" class="toggler"
                            alt="Icon">
                    </div>
                    <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-a-2"> Cash prizes worth ₹3 Lakh, scholarships to Masters’ Union PGP
                        programmes, internship opportunities with partner D2C brands, and some really cool merch. </p>
                </div>
                <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30 " data-rel="tab-a-3">
                    <div class="left">
                        <p class="faqHeading">How will our submissions be evaluated? </p>

                        <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg" class="toggler"
                            alt="Icon">
                    </div>
                    <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-a-3"> Based on clarity, feasibility, boldness of the idea, and how well
                        you build context in the 1-pager and video. Top 15 teams move to the Bengaluru round. </p>
                </div>
                <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30 " data-rel="tab-a-4">
                    <div class="left">
                        <p class="faqHeading">Can teams be changed after registration? </p>

                        <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg" class="toggler"
                            alt="Icon">
                    </div>
                    <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-a-4"> No. Team composition cannot be changed once registered. Each
                        participant can only be part of one team.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30 " data-rel="tab-a-5">
                    <div class="left">
                        <p class="faqHeading">Is individual participation allowed? </p>

                        <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg" class="toggler"
                            alt="Icon">
                    </div>
                    <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-a-5"> No, individual participation is not allowed. Each team must
                        consist of a minimum of three members from the same institution. Collaboration and teamwork form
                        a key part of the competition’s learning experience.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30 " data-rel="tab-a-6">
                    <div class="left">
                        <p class="faqHeading">Are there any registration or participation fees? </p>

                        <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg" class="toggler"
                            alt="Icon">
                    </div>
                    <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-a-6"> No, participation is completely free for invited colleges. </p>
                </div>
                <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30 " data-rel="tab-a-7">
                    <div class="left">
                        <p class="faqHeading">Will Masters’ Union provide travel or accommodation for regionals or
                            finals? </p>

                        <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg" class="toggler"
                            alt="Icon">
                    </div>
                    <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-a-7"> No. Travel and accommodation arrangements will have to be made by
                        participants themselves. Masters’ Union will provide necessary logistical details for smooth
                        coordination. </p>
                </div>
                <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30 " data-rel="tab-a-8">
                    <div class="left">
                        <p class="faqHeading">What if we miss the submission deadline? </p>

                        <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg" class="toggler"
                            alt="Icon">
                    </div>
                    <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-a-8"> Late submissions will not be accepted under any circumstances.
                        Teams are advised to adhere strictly to all deadlines. </p>
                </div>
                <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30 " data-rel="tab-a-9">
                    <div class="left">
                        <p class="faqHeading">Can we use external data or consult mentors? </p>

                        <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg" class="toggler"
                            alt="Icon">
                    </div>
                    <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-a-9"> Yes, you can use publicly available data or insights from
                        mentors. However, all analysis, ideation, and final submissions must be done solely by your
                        team. </p>
                </div>

                <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30 " data-rel="tab-a-11">
                    <div class="left">
                        <p class="faqHeading">Who can we reach out to for queries? </p>

                        <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg" class="toggler"
                            alt="Icon">
                    </div>
                    <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-a-11">Write to us at <a class="link-red"
                            href="mailto:groundzero1.0@mastersunion.org" >
                            groundzero1.0@mastersunion.org
                        </a> with your queries.
                    </p>
                </div>


            </div>


        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<script>
    $(document).ready(function () {
        $('.faqquestionWrap .faqanswer').not(':first').slideUp();
        $('.faqquestionWrap').off('click').on('click', function (event) {
            event.stopPropagation(); // Prevent event from propagating up the DOM tree
            let id = $(this).attr('data-rel');
            $(this).toggleClass('active').siblings().removeClass('active');
            $('#' + id).slideToggle().parent().siblings().find('.faqanswer').slideUp();
        });
    });
    function showApplyNowPopUp() {
        let applyNowPopUp = document.getElementById("ApplyNowPopUpNEW");
        if (applyNowPopUp) {
            applyNowPopUp.classList.add("active")
        }
    }



</script>